            [
              "resolver",
              "**resuelto**",
              "he resuelto"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs built on them inherit the irregular form: **deshacer → deshecho**, **describir → descrito**, **devolver → devuelto**, **descubrir → descubierto**, **proponer → propuesto**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Only **hacer** and **decir** (and verbs built on them, like **deshecho**) end in **-cho**: **hecho**, **dicho**. Everything else in the list ends in **-to**."
        }
